---
import Layout from '../components/layout/Layout.astro';

const title = "Terms of Use | Love4Prompts";
const description = "Terms of Use for Love4Prompts. Learn about prompt ownership, API usage rules, and acceptable use guidelines.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-black relative z-10 font-['Inter']">
    <div class="mb-12 border-b-8 border-black pb-8">
      <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-black tracking-tighter mb-4 text-black uppercase">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="text-[#FF6D87] text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-black inline-block px-4 py-2">Last updated: June 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#1482A3] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#FF6D87] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">1. Acceptance</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed text-lg">
          By accessing or using love4prompts, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Use. By using this website, you also agree to our Privacy Policy and acknowledge that your data may be processed by our third-party service providers as described therein. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the tool.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#1482A3] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#FF6D87] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">2. What love4prompts Is</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed text-lg">
          love4prompts is a free AI prompt enhancement toolkit. We provide AI-generated suggestions to help structure your prompts for third-party AI models. Because AI output is dynamic, results are provided "as is" and are not guaranteed to be accurate, complete, or suitable for any specific context.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#1482A3] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#FF6D87] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">3. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed text-lg">
          You agree to use this tool responsibly. You explicitly agree not to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-8 text-gray-800 font-bold leading-relaxed text-lg space-y-3">
          <li>Use the tool to generate prompts designed to create harmful, illegal, abusive, or malicious content.</li>
          <li>Attempt to reverse engineer, scrape, or systematically exploit the backend API.</li>
          <li>Use automated scripts or bots to mass-generate prompts through the service.</li>
          <li>Misrepresent AI-generated content as human-written in contexts where that distinction is required.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#1482A3] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#FF6D87] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-8 text-gray-800 font-bold leading-relaxed text-lg space-y-3">
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Your Input:</span> The raw prompts you type remain yours. We do not claim ownership over any text you enter.</li>
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">AI Output:</span> The enhanced output generated by our tool is yours to use, copy, and modify freely.</li>
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Platform Rights:</span> The love4prompts name, logo, site architecture, and product designs are owned by eMitra Technologies and are protected by intellectual property laws.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#1482A3] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#FF6D87] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">5. User Generated Content</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed text-lg">
          We do not take any guarantee of the content uploaded, submitted, or shared by users on our platform. All user-generated content is the sole responsibility of the person from whom such content originated. We do not endorse any user content and disclaim any liability in connection with it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#1482A3] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#FF6D87] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">6. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed text-lg">
          This service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free service and are not liable for any direct, indirect, or consequential damages arising from your use of the toolkit.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#1482A3] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#FF6D87] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed text-lg">
          If you have any questions or feedback regarding these terms, reach out to us at <a href="mailto:nishchaydev@outlook.com" class="text-black font-black border-b-4 border-[#FF6D87] hover:bg-[#FF6D87] hover:text-white transition-all">nishchaydev@outlook.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
